echo "$(sw_vers | awk '/ProductVersion:/{v=$2}/BuildVersion:/{b=$2}END{print "macOS "v" ("b")"}'), Uptime: $(uptime | sed -E 's/.*up ([^,]*).*/\1/')"
echo "Battery: $(pmset -g batt | grep -Eo '\d+%'), $(system_profiler SPPowerDataType | sed -nE 's/^.*Cycle Count: ([0-9]+)/Cycle count: \1/p')"
echo "Free space: $(df -H / | awk 'NR==2 {print $4}')"
echo "Shell: $(echo $SHELL | sed 's|/bin/||')"
